Left: sign · Right: its element · F Fire · A Air · W Water · E Earth

Reading

House 1 · Querent · Self
  Fortuna Minor — Good health and quick energy, but strength that is soon spent.

House 2 · Wealth
  Conjunctio — Money gained through partnership or by bringing things together.

House 3 · Siblings
  Via — Much coming and going; news, letters and short trips, but little settled.

House 4 · Home
  Via — Removal from the home or a change of residence; the matter will not hold.

House 5 · Children
  Amissio — Good for love affairs, which consume the heart; bad for pregnancy.

House 6 · Illness
  Laetitia — Recovery from illness and contentment at work.

House 7 · Partnership
  Populus — Many suitors or rivals; a partnership with the public. Thieves are many and
  hidden among others.

House 8 · Death
  Albus — A peaceful passing; fair dealings in inheritance.

House 9 · Journeys
  Laetitia — Joyful journeys; spiritual uplift.

House 10 · Honour
  Amissio — Loss of position or reputation.

House 11 · Friends
  Cauda Draconis — Friends depart; hopes end.

House 12 · Sorrow
  Conjunctio — Hidden enemies combine against the querent; a confinement shared.
